================ System Specifications ================

Operating System:
Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS

Architecture:
x86_64

Compiler:
GNU Fortran (gfortran) 11.4.0

Linked Libraries:
FFTW: /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libfftw3.so.3
LAPACK: /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/liblapack.so.3

